      en: ["The city was first mentioned in the Primary Chronicle in 859.", "Saint Sophia Cathedral was constructed between 1045 and 1050.", "The Novgorod Republic functioned as an independent state until 1478.", "Over 1,000 birch bark manuscripts have been excavated in the city.", "The Millennium of Russia monument was unveiled in the Kremlin in 1862.", "UNESCO designated the historic monuments of Novgorod as a World Heritage site in 1992."],
