      en: ["The Trinity Lavra of St. Sergius was founded around 1337.", "From 1930 to 1991, the city was officially known as Zagorsk.", "The monastery complex was listed as a UNESCO World Heritage site in 1993.", "The Lavra withstood a massive 16-month siege starting in 1608.", "The city is located approximately 70 kilometers northeast of Moscow.", "It is considered the historic production center of the first Matryoshka doll."],
