      en: ["Anadyr was established in 1889 under the name Novo-Mariinsk.", "It is the easternmost city in Russia, located at approximately 177° East.", "The Holy Trinity Cathedral was constructed without using a single metal nail.", "Ugolny Airport is situated on the opposite side of the Anadyr estuary.", "The average temperature in January is approximately -22 degrees Celsius.", "The city has a population of roughly 15,000 residents as of 2021."],
