      en: ["Yelets was first mentioned in the Nikon Chronicle in 1146.", "The Ascension Cathedral stands 74 meters tall, making it one of Russia's largest.", "The traditional Yelets lace-making industry began in the early 19th century.", "The city was nearly completely destroyed in 1395 by the conqueror Tamerlane.", "Nobel laureate Ivan Bunin attended the local gymnasium from 1881 to 1886.", "The city contains over 200 protected historical and architectural monuments."],
