      en: ["Yakutsk was established in 1632 by the explorer Pyotr Beketov.", "The city experiences an average January temperature of approximately -38 °C.", "Yakutsk is located on the Lena River, which can reach 10 km in width here.", "There is no permanent bridge across the Lena; an ice road is used in winter.", "The Mammoth Museum houses over 2,000 prehistoric specimens.", "Roughly 25% of the world's diamond production originates from the Sakha Republic."],
