      en: ["Founded in 1951, it achieved city status only three years later in 1954.", "The Volga Hydroelectric Station was the world's largest when completed.", "Current population stands at approximately 321,000 residents.", "Home to the Volzhsky Pipe Plant, a major global steel pipe producer.", "The city covers an area of roughly 150 square kilometers.", "Features a large botanical garden founded in 1995 for regional research."],
      es: ["Fundada en 1951", "Derecho de ciudad en 1954", "Población: unos 320.000 (2021)", "Central hidroeléctrica del Volga: 2.560 MW de potencia, terminada en 1961", "La fábrica de neumáticos Volzhsky (Pirelli) produce 4 millones de neumáticos al año", "Aeropuerto de Volgogrado (IATA: VOG) a 25 km"],
